      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Setagaya",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The ward’s official symbols are the azure‑winged magpie, the fringed orchid, and the Zelkova serrata tree, reflecting its natural heritage.",
